PATENTS and AUTHORS accompany this adaptation.
The pixel algorithm is unchanged. The adapter replaces WebPPicture and
WebP allocation helpers with a bounded in-place array API and malloc/free.
The caller can transpose the logical dimensions of x-major pixels because
the four-neighbor algorithm is transpose invariant. Tests verify this.
